        {
          "id": 699258950,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "The backticks get rendered as `<code>` blocks, so it looks like we need to substitute literal backticks in html2text.py. We should probably substitute literal double quotes for `<span class=\"guimenu\">` as well.\n\nPeople do read the release notes, although I'm not sure if they read the [HTML version](https://www.wireshark.org/docs/relnotes/) or the [text version](https://www.wireshark.org/lists/wireshark-announce/). I suspect it's both.\n\ndocbook/README.adoc is for anyone who wants to work with the documentation toolchain. It would be nice if it rendered nicely in GitLab but I'm not *too* concerned about that since it's easy enough to look at the source.",
          "author": {
            "id": 860017,
            "username": "geraldcombs",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Gerald Combs",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/860017/avatar.png?v=1789948913",
